# Emulators built into the image, one RetroPie-Setup package per line, in build order.
# Each line becomes one Dockerfile layer: append new packages at the end, so that only they
# are built; removing or reordering a line rebuilds everything after it.
# To choose your own set, copy this file to packages.local (ignored by git) or run
# `make packages-choose`. `make packages-check` validates the names against RetroPie-Setup.
# A comment after a package is copied into the Dockerfile above its line.
lr-snes9x
dolphin
lr-flycast-dev      # upstream flyinghead/flycast; lr-flycast (the libretro fork) no longer builds (RetroPie-Setup #4236)
lr-mame2003
lr-mame2015
lr-mame2016
lr-pcsx-rearmed
lr-quicknes
lr-parallel-n64
lr-mupen64plus-next
scummvm
lr-vice             # Commodore 64, 128, VIC-20, Plus/4: not part of basic_install on x86
